Edit only when clearly needed:
- `src/App.tsx`
- shared layout files
- shared mock data/type files
- global CSS files

Free to edit:
- `src/components/*`
- `src/pages/*`
- `src/data/*`
- `src/lib/*`
- `src/hooks/*`
- `src/types/*`
- feature-specific app files
